#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0664 expect=noViolation domain=VS
#note "VSCUSTOM is not in the model list. The order is judged only over the variables the model list knows (owner, 2026-10-02), so it is ignored here; whether it is allowed at all is CG0013 / SD0058's business. Before the change the first unknown variable ended the ordered-subset walk and the rule fired for an order that is correct."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#library model-column-order VS STUDYID DOMAIN USUBJID VSSEQ VSGRPID VSTESTCD VSTEST VSCAT VSPOS VSORRES VSORRESU
dataset VS class=FINDINGS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col VSSEQ    type=Num
col VSTESTCD type=Char
col VSCUSTOM type=Char
col VSTEST   type=Char
col VSORRES  type=Char
---
S1 | VS | 001 | 1 | X1 | X | Test | 1
---
